{"id":"vod_jy_37662","vodId":"37662","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"钢之炼金术师FA","name_cn":"钢之炼金术师FA","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第64集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/c712da56ef432ac2c0485556cf452be6.jpg"},"summary":"炼金术，一种建立在等价交换原则基础上的科学，将物质进行理解、分解、再构造，将一种物品变成另外一种。但是，这样先进的技术却不能进行人体炼成，这是炼金术绝对的禁忌。可是，拥有极高炼金术天赋的爱德华（朴璐美暂无内容配音）和阿尔冯斯（钉宫理恵暂无内容配音）兄弟，因为对母亲极大的思念不惜触犯禁忌。而最终的代价却是，爱德华失去了一条手臂和一条腿，弟弟阿尔冯斯只能将灵魂依附在一副巨大的装甲之内。终于明白一切的兄弟俩，为了恢复原状，寻求更多的炼金术知识，成为国家炼金术师踏上了寻找终极炼金物品——贤者之石的旅程。在不断的探索中，两兄弟终于发现了贤者之石背后的真相，对身处的这个军事化国家也有了更深入的了解。此时，面对国家、民族、家庭……炼金术的未来究竟在何处。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-26 11:16:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b821XRoe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/elYx8q6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/elYx8qla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aOYMJ4Nd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eXDLY4me/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aM8w733e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eVOAJ31a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bDk1w3na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/en5xGwld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/erk8gz6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aADN80Be/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/erk8gzwa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b2kxGLvd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e0RYAGXb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dwpVnJwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b4xQWM6b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"